Playing a wizard yesterday, I was down to Dlvl 4, and doing quite well,
when I found a marble wand. Lo and behold, it was a wand of wishing.
Only the second I have ever found just lying around in the dungeon. Now,
wizard was decked out in +2 gdsm, +2 speed boots, +2 Stormbringer (then
+5 with newly wished for blessed magic marker). 
Question: Is it now possible to die within 500 moves.

Answer: Of course.
Wizard only started with strength 9. Unwittingly eating something
poisonous had reduced that to 5. Then quaffing at a fountain reduced it
to 3. Then two quaffs later, the same message;
    "This water is contaminated"
    "You die!"
I had no idea being poisoned when your strength was at minimum was
(apparently) automatic death. Best character I've had for months,
killed by a FOUNTAIN!!

